      "name": "Fan of Daggers",
      "actions": 2,
      "category": "offensive",
      "text": "Sad Liza makes three ranged dagger Strikes, each against a separate target; she ignores the multiple attack penalty until after making all three Strikes. On a critical hit, the target takes 2d10 bleed damage and is Blinded for 1 round."
